Cell["\<\
Enter \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]no\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] to use all skeleton \
points (refined or unrefined) for statistical analysis. Otherwise, enter \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]yes\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] to only use the mean width \
value of each skeleton segment (only one width value per skeleton segment). \
Using all skeleton points results in a length-weighted width distribution \
while reporting the mean of each skeleton segment is closer to a \
number-weighted width distribution. \
\>", "CodeText",
 Editable->"False",
 Deletable->"False",
